Package: isoENV
Title: Tools to work with isolated environments for in-memory pipelines in
    R.
Version: 0.3.5
Authors@R: 
    person("Abel", "Vertesy", , "av@imba.oeaw.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: isoENV is a set of R functions to invoke scripts in isolated,
    and controlled environments for in-memory pipelines in R. Useful for
    single-session pipelines and exploratory data analysis.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
BugReports: https://github.com/vertesy/isoENV/issues
